import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 853 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Ultimate Argument of Anti-Predation Philosophy","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 853 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Ultimate Argument of Anti-Predation Philosophy","no":853,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Anti-Predation","Ultimate Argument","Causality","Predatory Cultivation"],"related":["04-Anti-Predationism Core Thesis","057-Dark Substitution Body Origin and Essence","728-The Parasitic Essence of Predatory-School Transcended-Ones","852-Symbiosis Philosophy Construction"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0853_模块4-超脱者与哲学-反掠夺终极论证.md","filePath":"en/0853_模块4-超脱者与哲学-反掠夺终极论证.md"}'),o={name:"en/0853_模块4-超脱者与哲学-反掠夺终极论证.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,d,u){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-853-transcended-ones-and-philosophy-the-ultimate-argument-of-anti-predation-philosophy" tabindex="-1">Entry 853 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Ultimate Argument of Anti-Predation Philosophy <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-853-transcended-ones-and-philosophy-the-ultimate-argument-of-anti-predation-philosophy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 853 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Ultimate Argument of Anti-Predation Philosophy&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 57, 728, 852</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-predation-is-losing-in-the-ultimate-sense" tabindex="-1">Introduction: why predation is &quot;losing&quot; in the ultimate sense <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-predation-is-losing-in-the-ultimate-sense" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: why predation is &quot;losing&quot; in the ultimate sense&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old worldview never doubts predation. It defaults: power is taken by grabbing; the strong prey on the weak as a matter of course. All wish-fulfillment protagonists are essentially &quot;high-level predators.&quot; What Heng Yuan Zhou must do is not morally scold predation, but philosophically completely prove: <strong>predation is not only shameful, but in the ultimate sense a losing and self-destructive thing.</strong> This entry gives anti-predation philosophy&#39;s ultimate argument — why predatory cultivation cannot reach the end, why strong ones who &quot;harvest all beings&quot; are ultimately backfired by causality. This is the entire Module 4&#39;s most fundamental theoretical cornerstone.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally burst forth: <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> is the argument object itself; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> is the argument&#39;s core mechanism; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> is predation&#39;s opposite; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> is what predation would destroy; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires this argument be logically rigorous, self-consistent, and unassailable.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-predation-s-triple-self-destruct-structure" tabindex="-1">I. Predation&#39;s Triple Self-Destruct Structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-predation-s-triple-self-destruct-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Predation&#39;s Triple Self-Destruct Structure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Why can predatory cultivation (devouring others&#39; energy, seizing resources, harvesting fortune) not reach the top? Because it has a triple self-destruct structure:</p><ol><li><strong>Energy-structure self-destruction</strong>: predated energy is &quot;exogenous,&quot; incompatible with one&#39;s own origin. Document 04 already argues: predatory cultivators&#39; energy has &quot;original sin&quot;; the higher and deeper, the greater the hidden wound; ultimately stuck before the Origin Realm — this is the ceiling root of Tang Luo, Tang San and their ilk.</li><li><strong>Causal-structure self-destruction</strong>: every predation leaves a causal account in Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision. The old world says &quot;kill and set fire, gold belts at the waist&quot;; that is because the ledger has not settled; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s causal law is perpetual — what you harvest will ultimately flow back to you at greater cost. This is entry 859 &quot;historical correction&quot;&#39;s account to be settled.</li><li><strong>Ecological-structure self-destruction</strong>: predation damages Myriad-Rank origin bidirectional circulation (entry 852). Every being you devour leaves one less link in the circulation; the more you devour, the more the circulation you depend on dries up. <strong>The predator is digging the root under his own feet.</strong></li></ol><h2 id="ii-why-harvesting-fortune-is-the-greatest-self-deception" tabindex="-1">II. Why &quot;Harvesting Fortune&quot; Is the Greatest Self-Deception <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-harvesting-fortune-is-the-greatest-self-deception" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why &quot;Harvesting Fortune&quot; Is the Greatest Self-Deception&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old worldview has a tempting claim: the protagonist harvests Myriad Ranks&#39; fortune, therefore he is strong. Heng Yuan Zhou must burst this greatest self-deception:</p><ul><li><strong>Fortune is not stock, it is circulation&#39;s product.</strong> The better Myriad Ranks are, the more prosperous the circulation, the more abundant the fortune; you harvesting Myriad Ranks is cutting the circulation&#39;s source;</li><li><strong>The stronger the harvester, the greater the backfire.</strong> After he squeezes Myriad Ranks dry, he himself becomes water without a source — Ye Fan&#39;s loneliness, Zheng Zha&#39;s nothingness after reincarnation harvest, are essentially this;</li><li><strong>The Dark Substitution Body&#39;s lesson</strong> (Document 57): an existence born by devouring others&#39; origin is from the root diseased; however strong, it is a cosmic lesion, not the cosmic direction.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-ultimate-argument-predation-is-doomed-before-the-balanced-anchor-hyper-multiverse-realm" tabindex="-1">III. Ultimate Argument: Predation Is Doomed Before the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-ultimate-argument-predation-is-doomed-before-the-balanced-anchor-hyper-multiverse-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Ultimate Argument: Predation Is Doomed Before the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Pushing triple self-destruction to the limit gives anti-predation&#39;s ultimate argument:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Comparison</th><th>Predatory Path</th><th>Symbiotic Path</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Energy</td><td>Exogenous, hidden wounds</td><td>Endogenous, pure</td></tr><tr><td>Causality</td><td>In debt, must repay eventually</td><td>Contribution, accumulating civilizational weight</td></tr><tr><td>Circulation</td><td>Damaged, narrower and narrower</td><td>Maintained, wider and wider</td></tr><tr><td>End point</td><td>Exhaustion, loneliness, crash</td><td>Perpetuity, symbiosis, uplift</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Conclusion: <strong>the predator may win for a while, but he cannot win to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm.</strong> Because what that realm requires is precisely what he lacks most — circulating with Myriad Ranks, trusted by Myriad Ranks, clean causality. The stronger the predator, the farther he is from that realm. This is why entry 728 judges predatory-school transcended ones essentially &quot;parasitic&quot; — he is not transcended, he is a tumor living off the host.</p><h2 id="iv-this-argument-s-practical-significance" tabindex="-1">IV. This Argument&#39;s Practical Significance <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-this-argument-s-practical-significance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. This Argument&#39;s Practical Significance&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This is not a logic game in a study. It directly answers Myriad Ranks&#39; deepest doubt: &quot;the strong prey, what do we do?&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is: <strong>do not fear; predation in the ultimate sense is doomed to lose.</strong> You do not have to imitate predators to win — walk the symbiotic road and outrun predators long-term. This conviction itself is anti-predation&#39;s public defense line.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: argue the predatory path is a &quot;narrower and narrower&quot; dead end, from the root persuading Myriad Ranks not to take it</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: triple self-destruct structure proves predation is not only immoral, but does not hold</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo, Tang San, Zheng Zha and other predatory/harvest-type protagonists are precisely triple self-destruct&#39;s living examples</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the argument tells Myriad Ranks &quot;your circulation participation right&quot; is inalienable — deprive it, the cosmos loses</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the argument process, cases, and ledger all public, accepting Myriad Ranks&#39; test</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-the-argument-s-public-test" tabindex="-1">Supplement: The Argument&#39;s Public Test <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-the-argument-s-public-test" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: The Argument&#39;s Public Test&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This triple self-destruct structure&#39;s argument does not accept &quot;I have the final say.&quot; It must be placed before Myriad Ranks for public test: every historical case, every causal account, every consequence of circulation damage, all are documented in Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision archives. Myriad Ranks may question, may refute; the argument holds only if it withstands the test. Precisely because of this, anti-predation is not a morality the transcended one imposes on Myriad Ranks, but Myriad Ranks&#39; own choice after seeing pros and cons — once seen, no longer need to imitate predators to survive.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Anti-predation philosophy&#39;s ultimate argument is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s deepest overturn of the old worldview. It is no longer moral preaching &quot;you should not rob,&quot; but cold proof &quot;even if you rob you cannot win&quot; — energy has hidden wounds, causality must be repaid, circulation is cut off; the stronger the predator, the farther from the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm. When Myriad Ranks understand predation is a self-destruct dead end and symbiosis is the only road that reaches the end, anti-predation is no longer an externally imposed rule, but every being&#39;s choice out of its own interest. This is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s solidest philosophical foundation.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predationism Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/57-黑暗置换体起源与本质.html">Entry 57 · Dark Substitution Body Origin and Essence</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/728_模块4-对比掠夺派超脱者的寄生本质.html">Entry 728 · The Parasitic Essence of Predatory-School Transcended-Ones</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/852_模块4-超脱者与哲学-共生哲学建构.html">Entry 852 · Symbiosis Philosophy Construction</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
